      "key": [
        "Jean's mother",
        "Jean's childhood",
        "Jean and Frederica"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Frederica Gunnhildr: Jean's upbringing",
      "content": "Frederica trained Jean in discipline, etiquette, history, ballads and swordsmanship. Jean's birthdays were marked by a simple trip to Windrise. Jean now says her Vision reminds her of her mother and of Mondstadt's hopes.\n\nAs a child Jean waited outside headquarters with perfect scores until Frederica told her she need not be perfect and could make mistakes.",
