      "key": [
        "Seamus Pegg",
        "Cardinal of Daybreak"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Frederica",
        "Alder Knight"
      ],
      "comment": "Frederica Gunnhildr: Seamus Pegg and the marriage",
      "content": "Frederica met and married the adventurer Seamus Pegg, who became the Church's Cardinal of Daybreak. They had Jean and Barbara. A rift ended the marriage; Jean stayed with her mother and Barbara went with her father.\n\nVarka's story shows Seamus coming to Mondstadt with Varka, half in jest saying he wanted to see this Freder-, then correcting himself to the dandelion wine.",
