      "comment": "Frederica Gunnhildr: Varka's expedition and Dornman Port",
      "content": "Frederica was second-in-command of Varka's expedition. When its discoveries sent Varka to Nod-Krai, she and several knights were ordered back to defend Dornman Port.\n\nIn a flagship event (4.7) a knight guessed she would lead the reformed 7th Company on her return.",
